  unitName: Ruby Successor Reda
  unitId: 10717
  unitNumber: 1421
  description: Born in the Federation and raised in the Empire, Reda spent her life
    seeking a place where she truly belonged. Her frequent solitary activities after
    joining the Akras Summoners' Hall may have been due to an avoidance of close
    relationships for fear of revealing her marginalization. However, in contrast
    to her feelings, many in the Summoners' Hall were secretly fond of her. Had she
    accepted comrades, she likely could have formed a mighty contingent of demon
    slayers around herself.
  summonDesc: I will carry out her dying wish because now I understand that it will
    be the people's wishes that save the world, not any organization.
  fusionDesc: It's not about where you are. What matters is what you want to do.
    Once you figure that out, it's simple.
  evoDesc: I want to build a world where everyone can live free. I don't mind helping
    if that's the aim!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
